# ANTIPODE: the station: 98 rooms (33 in the Gantry, 29 in the Brine, 29 in
# the Coil, 7 in the Crown), 34 upgrades, 10 cradles; every room's things
# find a place, every room and upgrade can be reached, the words fit, the
# art is whole and every tune's channels loop together.
seed 1
game antipode
wait 5
expect nrooms == 98
expect rooms_0 == 33
expect rooms_1 == 29
expect rooms_2 == 29
expect rooms_3 == 7
expect nitems == 34
expect npods == 10
expect place == 0
expect reach == 0
expect layout == 0
expect art_bad == 0
check_songs
